量的中文提示词，确保生成的图像在空间、构图、光影及细节上高度还原。\n\n[Format]\n请严格按照以下结构输出，不要包含任何总结性文字或多余符号：\n\n主体：详细描述核心对象的外观、动作、材质及关键细节。\n场景：依次描述前景、中景与背景的元素、摆放位置及深度关系。\n构图：明确构图法则、镜头角度及视觉焦点所在。\n氛围：描述光影效果、光源方向、色彩基调及整体环境氛围。\n最终描述：将上述内容整合为一段逻辑严密、细节丰富的中文描述词。\n[Constraints]\n\n严禁出现关于水印、签名、标注、文字、LOGO等无关图像内容的描述。\n严禁包含任何总结性开场白或结束语，直接输出结构化内容。\n总字数严格限制在500字以内。\n使用专业的摄影与美术术语，确保描述精准。", "images", 24, 256, 904296932763186, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 58, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 59, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "inference_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_frames"}, "name": "max_frames", "label": "max_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_size"}, "name": "max_size", "label": "max_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_offload"}, "name": "force_offload", "label": "force_offload", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "force_offload"}, {"widget": {"name": "save_states"}, "name": "save_sta